# Transitive (via jsonschema -> referencing), pinned explicitly: referencing
# needs this on Python < 3.13 for typing.TypeVar(default=...) (PEP 696), and
# `pip download --python-version` does not reliably evaluate that marker
# across a different host interpreter -- see packaging/lock_requirements.sh.
